Teaching Plan brief verbatim;\\\\n- match requested difficulty;\\\\n- be answerable from lesson state available at this point.\\\\n\\\\nDo not change the interaction kind. Do not add another learner task. Do not write content that belongs in neighboring document nodes.\\\\n\\\\nWhen converting an approved assessment item, preserve approved meaning and answer ownership.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nCapability: choice.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAuthor a complete activity envelope: student-facing prompt, choice config, and feedback.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Write the prompt as a clear question the learner reads directly. The planning brief is context only \\\\u2014 do not copy it verbatim.\\\\r\\\\n- Provide feedback.correct and feedback.incorrect messages tied to the question and distractors.\\\\r\\\\n- Put options and the correct option id in config.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Use at least two options with unique stable ids.\\\\r\\\\n- Exactly one option is correct.\\\\r\\\\n- Distractors must be plausible and tied to a stateable misconception.\\\\r\\\\n- Do not use this for questions with several defensible answers.\",\\n    \"intent\": \"orient\",\\n    \"lane\": \"interaction\",\\n    \"modes\": [\\n      \"generate\",\\n      \"convert-approved\"\\n    ],\\n    \"payload_schema\": {\\n      \"additionalProperties\": true,\\n      \"properties\": {\\n        \"config\": {\\n          \"$id\": \"learn/choice/config.v1\",\\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\\n          \"properties\": {\\n            \"correct_option_id\": {\\n              \"minLength\": 1,\\n              \"type\": \"string\"\\n            },\\n            \"options\": {\\n              \"items\": {\\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\\n                \"properties\": {\\n                  \"explanation\": {\\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\\n                  },\\n                  \"id\": {\\n                    \"minLength\": 1,\\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\\n                  }