hout the lesson we will trace how the plant uses them to make the food it needs.\",\\n    \"incorrect\": \"Your guess gives food from the soil, the water, or the sunlight. Each of those is taken in or used by the plant, but none of them is the plant\\'s food. Keep your idea and we will test it together as we learn how plants make their own food.\"\\n  }\\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '1 validation error:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \"type\": \"missing\",\\n    \"loc\": [\\n      \"response\"\\n    ],\\n    \"msg\": \"Field required\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\nFix the errors and try again.'}], 'model': 'deepseek-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 8000, 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'disabled'}}}"}
